Optional offline transcription assets for SiloCityLabs/recording

Third-party works under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt).
Binaries are downloaded at user opt-in from free CORS-enabled CDNs (not shipped
in the Pages deploy):

1. vosk-browser
   Copyright (c) Ciaran O'Reilly and contributors
   https://github.com/ccoreilly/vosk-browser
   Version: 0.0.8
   Browser source: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vosk-browser@0.0.8/dist/vosk.js

2. Per-language Vosk small models (Alphacephei / vosk-browser demo mirror)
   Upstream: https://alphacephei.com/vosk/models
   Browser mirror (CORS *): https://ccoreilly.github.io/vosk-browser/models/
   - vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15.tar.gz       (English; also used for en-GB)
   - vosk-model-small-es-0.3.tar.gz           (Spanish)
   - vosk-model-small-fr-pguyot-0.3.tar.gz    (French)
   - vosk-model-small-de-0.15.tar.gz          (German)

Only one language model is stored on the device at a time (plus vosk.js).
Switching transcription language in Settings replaces the stored model.

Vosk builds on Kaldi speech recognition software. See upstream projects for the
full contributor notices.
